        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D06-K240-FPT, Fairport Lever with Roped Academy Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Brass Accents, this ornate latchset features a beautiful and unique lever. It is this Fairport Lever that really brings out the grandeur of the Academy Plate. Together, the Academy Plate with Fairport Lever is a perfect example of understated elegance. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions in a wide array of finishes. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D06-K240-FPT Academy Plate with Fairport Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button and turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Academy Plate with Fairport Lever, Brass Accents D05-K447-KIN",
                "description": "Brass Accents D06-K240-FPT, Academy Plate with Fairport Lever - Made by Brass Accents, this ornate latchset features a beautiful and unique crystal lever. It is this Fairport Lever that really brings out the grandeur of the Academy Plate. Together, the Academy Plate with Fairport Lever is a perfect example of understated elegance. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions in a wide array of finishes. It will fit doors that are 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
